# Checklist 26 and 27, by screenshot: Jupiter's info panel keeps its long
# narrative inside the panel, and the share view's caption fits. Phase
# 129 has no long-name target to give the share view; Jupiter checks the
# ordinary name is still drawn full size.
name    Panels: Jupiter's info panel and the share view
timeout 180

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Panels
wait   3
goto   Jupiter
expect 120 Slew to 'Jupiter' complete
wait   4
shot   object
press  SHARE VIEW ON
expect 5   [SHARE] view on
wait   3
shot   share
press  SHARE VIEW
